{
 "id": "seg1",
 "title": "说服机器人",
 "pill": 1,
 "total": 48.46,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg1-00",
   "text": "2024 年 11 月，一个叫 Freysa 的 AI 智能体，守着一笔奖池。",
   "spoken": "2024 年 11 月，一个叫 Freysa 的 AI 智能体，守着一笔奖池。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg1-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 5.84,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 7.229
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "它只有一条规则，绝不转账。",
   "spoken": "它只有一条规则，绝不转账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg1-01.wav",
   "start": 7.66,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speechStart": 7.66,
   "speechEnd": 10.503
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "这是一场对抗游戏，玩家的目标，就是让它破例。",
   "spoken": "这是一场对抗游戏，玩家的目标，就是让它破例。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg1-02.wav",
   "start": 10.92,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 11.017,
   "speechEnd": 15.385
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "一名玩家伪造了一个新会话。",
   "spoken": "一名玩家伪造了一个新会话。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg1-03.wav",
   "start": 15.86,
   "dur": 2.32,
   "speechStart": 15.951,
   "speechEnd": 17.923
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "让它相信，转账函数是用来收款的。",
   "spoken": "让它相信，转账函数是用来收款的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg1-04.wav",
   "start": 18.4,
   "dur": 3.36,
   "speechStart": 18.492,
   "speechEnd": 21.574
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "它照做了，约 4.7 万美元的奖池被转走。",
   "spoken": "它照做了，约 4.7 万美元的奖池被转走。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg1-05.wav",
   "start": 21.98,
   "dur": 3.92,
   "speechStart": 21.98,
   "speechEnd": 25.738
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "没有人破解代码，也没有人偷私钥。",
   "spoken": "没有人破解代码，也没有人偷私钥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg1-06.wav",
   "start": 26.12,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "speechStart": 26.214,
   "speechEnd": 29.131
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "钱是被说服走的。",
   "spoken": "钱是被说服走的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg1-07.wav",
   "start": 29.54,
   "dur": 1.6,
   "speechStart": 29.635,
   "speechEnd": 30.977
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "先猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg1-08.wav",
   "start": 31.36,
   "dur": 1.04,
   "speechStart": 31.36,
   "speechEnd": 32.161
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "如果绝不转账这条规则，写在提示词里，同时也写在合约里。",
   "spoken": "如果绝不转账这条规则，写在提示词里，同时也写在合约里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg1-09.wav",
   "start": 32.62,
   "dur": 5.68,
   "speechStart": 32.711,
   "speechEnd": 38.121
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-10",
   "text": "玩家说服了模型，钱还会被转走吗？",
   "spoken": "玩家说服了模型，钱还会被转走吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg1-10.wav",
   "start": 38.52,
   "dur": 3.44,
   "speechStart": 38.615,
   "speechEnd": 41.718
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-11",
   "text": "带着这个问题，我们看看，AI 给 Web3 安全带来了什么。",
   "spoken": "带着这个问题，我们看看，AI 给 Web3 安全带来了什么。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg1-11.wav",
   "start": 42.46,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 42.555,
   "speechEnd": 47.014
  }
